---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Quick Photoshoot"
  description="Enjoy 20 minutes of natural, candid photography in one of the best outdoor locations in London and receive 20+ professionally retouched digital images."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-center">
          <div class="md:col-span-2">
            <img
              src="https://mellsnap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/1-1-1024x683.jpg"
              alt="Little blonde girl holding flowers sitting on a picnic blanket with her father"
              class="w-full aspect-[3/4] object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-3">
            <p class="label mb-4">Quick Snap Package</p>
            <h1
              class="font-cormorant text-4xl md:text-5xl text-primary-text mb-6"
            >
              Quick Photoshoot
            </h1>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-3xl text-pink mb-8">£120</p>

            <ul
              class="space-y-3 font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-8"
            >
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="w-5 h-5 text-pink mt-1 flex-shrink-0"
                  fill="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 448 512"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M384 32C419.3 32 448 60.65 448 96V416C448 451.3 419.3 480 384 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V96C0 60.65 28.65 32 64 32H384zM339.8 211.8C350.7 200.9 350.7 183.1 339.8 172.2C328.9 161.3 311.1 161.3 300.2 172.2L192 280.4L147.8 236.2C136.9 225.3 119.1 225.3 108.2 236.2C97.27 247.1 97.27 264.9 108.2 275.8L172.2 339.8C183.1 350.7 200.9 350.7 211.8 339.8L339.8 211.8z"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                20 minutes photo session
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="w-5 h-5 text-pink mt-1 flex-shrink-0"
                  fill="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 448 512"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M384 32C419.3 32 448 60.65 448 96V416C448 451.3 419.3 480 384 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V96C0 60.65 28.65 32 64 32H384zM339.8 211.8C350.7 200.9 350.7 183.1 339.8 172.2C328.9 161.3 311.1 161.3 300.2 172.2L192 280.4L147.8 236.2C136.9 225.3 119.1 225.3 108.2 236.2C97.27 247.1 97.27 264.9 108.2 275.8L172.2 339.8C183.1 350.7 200.9 350.7 211.8 339.8L339.8 211.8z"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                20+ professionally edited digital images
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="w-5 h-5 text-pink mt-1 flex-shrink-0"
                  fill="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 448 512"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M384 32C419.3 32 448 60.65 448 96V416C448 451.3 419.3 480 384 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V96C0 60.65 28.65 32 64 32H384zM339.8 211.8C350.7 200.9 350.7 183.1 339.8 172.2C328.9 161.3 311.1 161.3 300.2 172.2L192 280.4L147.8 236.2C136.9 225.3 119.1 225.3 108.2 236.2C97.27 247.1 97.27 264.9 108.2 275.8L172.2 339.8C183.1 350.7 200.9 350.7 211.8 339.8L339.8 211.8z"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                2-3 days delivery
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <svg
                  class="w-5 h-5 text-pink mt-1 flex-shrink-0"
                  fill="currentColor"
                  viewBox="0 0 448 512"
                >
                  <path
                    d="M384 32C419.3 32 448 60.65 448 96V416C448 451.3 419.3 480 384 480H64C28.65 480 0 451.3 0 416V96C0 60.65 28.65 32 64 32H384zM339.8 211.8C350.7 200.9 350.7 183.1 339.8 172.2C328.9 161.3 311.1 161.3 300.2 172.2L192 280.4L147.8 236.2C136.9 225.3 119.1 225.3 108.2 236.2C97.27 247.1 97.27 264.9 108.2 275.8L172.2 339.8C183.1 350.7 200.9 350.7 211.8 339.8L339.8 211.8z"
                  ></path>
                </svg>
                Secure online gallery
              </li>
            </ul>

            <Button href="/free-consultation/" variant="primary">
              Book a Free Consultation
            </Button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Introduction -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <p
          class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text leading-relaxed mb-6"
        >
          Not every photoshoot needs to take hours. A quick photoshoot can
          capture the most genuine smiles and memories from those candid and
          spontaneous moments. That's why I created the Quick Snap Photo
          Package—a short and easy session designed for anyone who wants
          stunning photos without the hassle of a long shoot.
        </p>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text leading-relaxed">
          It's perfect for families, couples, or even professionals looking for
          a fresh, natural portrait. Whether we meet at a beautiful park, your
          cosy home, or even your favourite coffee shop, we'll create something
          truly special together – all in just 20 minutes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Featured Image -->
  <section class="bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container py-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <img
          src="https://www.mellsnap.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/046-Web-1024x683.jpg"
          alt="Toddler covered in autumn leaves during a quick photoshoot"
          class="w-full aspect-[3/2] object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Included -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text mb-8">
          What's Included in My Quick Photoshoot Package?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mb-8">
          Here's what you'll get with this fun and simple package:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">A 20-minute photoshoot</strong> – Enough
            time to capture a variety of beautiful, natural shots.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text"
              >20 professionally edited digital images</strong
            > – You'll receive a gallery of polished, high-quality photos that you
            can print, share, or just treasure forever.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">Your choice of location</strong> – We
            can shoot outdoors, in your home, or at a coffee shop – whatever feels
            right for you.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">Natural and soft edit</strong> – Each
            image is carefully cropped and framed, with gentle, natural edits of the
            colours, lighting and white balance, there are no harsh filters or heavy
            retouching.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Choose -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text mb-8">
          Why Choose My Quick Snap Photo Package?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mb-10">
          I get it – sometimes, you just want amazing photos without spending a
          lot of time planning or posing. That's exactly what this package is
          for.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-cormorant text-2xl text-primary-text mb-3">
              1. Quick and Convenient
            </h3>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
              This session is all about keeping things simple. In just 20
              minutes, we'll create a set of gorgeous images that feel relaxed
              and effortless. It's perfect if you're short on time or just
              prefer a more casual experience.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-cormorant text-2xl text-primary-text mb-3">
              2. Flexible Locations
            </h3>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
              Want to head outdoors to a local park? Stay at home for some
              personal, cosy vibes? Or maybe pop into a coffee shop for a
              stylish lifestyle feel? The choice is yours, and I'll make it work
              beautifully.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-cormorant text-2xl text-primary-text mb-3">
              3. Professional, High-Quality Results
            </h3>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
              Even though it's a short session, I promise the same level of care
              and attention as my longer shoots. Every image is carefully edited
              to bring out the best moments and details.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-cormorant text-2xl text-primary-text mb-3">
              4. Perfect for Any Occasion
            </h3>
            <p class="font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
              Whether you're updating your family album, marking a milestone
              with your partner, or just want a new profile picture, this
              package is as versatile as it gets.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who Is This For -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text mb-8">
          Who Is This Package For?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mb-8">
          I recommend the quick photoshoot package for:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">Families</strong> – Quick, fun sessions
            where the kids can just be themselves.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">Couples</strong> – Perfect for capturing
            your connection in a relaxed, natural way.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">Professionals</strong> – Great for refreshing
            your headshot or LinkedIn profile.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">Anyone</strong> – If you want amazing
            photos but don't need a long photoshoot, this is for you!
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Locations -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-section-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary-text mb-8">
          Where Can We Shoot?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mb-8">
          Not sure where to hold your photoshoot? Here are some ideas:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 font-cormorant text-lg text-secondary-text mb-8">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">Local parks</strong> – I love working
            in spots like Richmond Park, Bushy Park, or Canbury Gardens.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">Your home</strong> – Nothing beats the
            personal touch of capturing you and your loved ones in your own space.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-primary-text">Coffee shops</strong> – Trendy, relaxed,
            and great for lifestyle portraits.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text">
          I can also recommend parks around London depending on the vibe you
          want to get from the photoshoot. Wherever we go, I'll guide you to
          make sure we make the most of our time together.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-beige">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="font-cormorant text-4xl md:text-5xl text-primary-text mb-6">
          Ready to Book Your Quick Photoshoot?
        </h2>
        <p class="font-cormorant text-xl text-secondary-text mb-10">
          Let's create something beautiful together – in just 20 minutes.
        </p>
        <Button href="/free-consultation/" variant="primary">
          Book a Free Consultation
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
